        "content": "<p>xia-chao opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14520\">PR #14520</a> from <code>xia-chao:wasi-write-permit-complete</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A stream has to trap when you write more than <code>check-write</code> allowed. Three don't:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/4b3cef0268cf52a079e07f1d39327121c13561a2/crates/wasi/src/p2/pipe.rs#L277-L290\"><code>SinkOutputStream</code></a> — a guest's stdout with <code>-Sinherit-stdout=n</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/4b3cef0268cf52a079e07f1d39327121c13561a2/crates/wasi/src/cli/file.rs#L49-L65\"><code>OutputFile</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/4b3cef0268cf52a079e07f1d39327121c13561a2/crates/c-api/src/wasi.rs#L212-L233\"><code>CustomOutputStream</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>They hand back a number and then take anything. All three always give the same number, so one<br>\ncheck is enough. Spec: <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/blob/4b3cef0268cf52a079e07f1d39327121c13561a2/crates/wasi-io/wit/deps/io.wit#L184-L204\">io.wit</a>.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
